  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商業簡報實務",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS PRESENTATION PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "透過專業企劃工具教學及個案實作，讓學生從商務企劃到簡報設計、口語表達至結合行銷傳播概念，掌握企劃流程，以培育學生說服力及邏輯企劃能力，並能應用於專題研究、競賽等專業工作上，厚植商務專業能力。",
    "describe_eh": "By teaching professional planning tools and case practice, students can master the planning process from business planning to presentation design, oral expression to combining marketing communication concepts, and cultivate students persuasive and logical planning abilities, which can be applied to unique research, competitions, Enrich students' professional business knowledge.",
